    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original raised-fossil-relief teaching slab: a low connected thin tube network forms19 closed hexagonal cells on an exposed substrate. Basic hexagonal tunnel architecture and unresolved producer supported by the accessed primary study Introduction; modern surface openings are not copied into this fossil-relief display. Original nominal0.24m module, tube thickness, grid extent and gray palette are art choices. No exact ichnospecies, excavated specimen replica, coral/honeycomb organism, proven farming/ventilation mechanism or producer assignment; original Paleogene inventory context is not a universal range or coexistence claim.",
      "zh": "原创凸起化石浮雕教学岩板：低矮相连细管网在露面基底上形成19个闭合六角单元。已读原始研究引言支持六角管网基本结构及制造者未确定；不将现代海底表面小孔照搬作本项化石浮雕。原创0.24米名义模块、管厚、网格范围及灰色为美术设定。不指定潜迹种，不复制出土标本，不作珊瑚或蜂巢生物，不主张已证实的耕作、通风机制或制造者；原始古近纪分类背景不代表完整时代范围或共存。"
    },
